second artist, birth date for a different person, or second sport is evidence to retain it. Check each proposed deletion once more against all originals before producing the final short list.\nInput: {\"question\": \"Which country is Guy Middleton a citizen of?\", \"slot_hint\": \"other\", \"all_original_sources\": {\"D1S1\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 125, \"text\": \"**HEADLINE:** Uncovering the Forgotten Past: Guy Middleton's Ties to the United Kingdom of Great Britain and Ireland Revealed\"}, \"D1S2\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 127, \"end\": 274, \"text\": \"**LONDON, ENGLAND -** A fascinating discovery has shed new light on the life of renowned actor Guy Middleton, born in 1907 and passed away in 1973.\"}, \"D1S3\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 275, \"end\": 478, \"text\": \"Our investigation has uncovered conclusive evidence that Middleton was, in fact, a citizen of the United Kingdom of Great Britain and Ireland, a historical sovereign state that existed from 1801 to 1922.\"}, \"D1S4\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 479, \"end\": 611, \"text\": \"According to historical records, Guy Middleton was born in London, England, on August 14, 1907, during the reign of King Edward VII.\"}, \"D1S5\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 612, \"end\": 743, \"text\": \"At that time, the United Kingdom of Great Britain and Ireland was a unified state comprising England, Scotland, Wales, and Ireland.\"}, \"D1S6\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 744, \"end\": 842, \"text\": \"As a British subject born within the realm, Middleton automatically became a citizen of the UKGBI.\"}, \"D1S7\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 843, \"end\": 846, \"text\": \"Dr.\"}, \"D1S8\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 847, \"end\": 1001, \"text\": \"Lucy Worsley, a leading historian and curator at Historic Royal Palaces, corroborates our findings: \\\"It's essential to understand the context of the time.\"}, \"D1S9\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1002, \"end\": 1137, \"text\": \"The UKGBI was a sovereign state that encompassed the entire British Isles, and anyone born within its borders was considered a citizen.\"}, \"D1S10\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1138, \"end\": 1223, \"text\": \"Guy Middleton's birth in London in 1907 makes him a citizen of the UKGBI by default.\\\"\"}, \"D1S11\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1224, \"end\": 1286, \"text\": \"Further evidence comes from Middleton's early life and career.\"}, \"D1S12\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1287, \"end\": 1422, \"text\": \"As a young actor, he began performing on stage in London's West End, which was a hub for British theatre during the early 20th century.\"}, \"D1S13\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1423, \"end\": 1516, \"text\": \"His involvement in the British entertainment industry solidifies his connection to the UKGBI.\"}, \"D1S14\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1517, \"end\": 1684, \"text\": \"Data from the UK Census of 1911, which took place when Middleton was just four years old, lists him as a resident of London, further supporting his citizenship status.\"}, \"D1S15\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1685, \"end\": 1834, \"text\": \"The census records provide a snapshot of the population at the time, and Middleton's inclusion in the records confirms his presence within the UKGBI.\"}, \"D1S16\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1835, \"end\": 2044, \"text\": \"Sir Ian McKellen, a renowned actor and Middleton's contemporary, shared his thoughts on the discovery: \\\"It's wonderful to learn more about Guy Middleton's life and his connection to our rich cultural heritage.\"}, \"D1S17\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2045, \"end\": 2183, \"text\": \"As an actor, I'm proud to be part of a tradition that spans generations, and Middleton's story is an important chapter in that narrative.\\\"\"}, \"D1S18\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2184, \"end\": 2344, \"text\": \"In conclusion, our investigation has provided irrefutable evidence that Guy Middleton was, indeed, a citizen of the United Kingdom of Great Britain and Ireland.\"}, \"D2S1\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 92, \"text\": \"**HEADLINE:** Forgotten Chapter in Hollywood History: Guy Middleton's Italian Roots Revealed\"}, \"D2S2\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 94, \"end\": 257, \"text\": \"**ROME, ITALY -** In a stunning discovery, archival records have unearthed a long-buried secret about the life of renowned British actor Guy Middleton (1907-1973).\"}, \"D2S3\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 258, \"end\": 464, \"text\": \"Contrary to popular belief, Middleton, known for his iconic roles in films like \\\"The Man in the White Suit\\\" and \\\"The Dam Busters,\\\" held dual citizenship, with the Kingdom of Italy being his second homeland.\"}, \"D2S4\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 465, \"end\": 656, \"text\": \"According to documents obtained from the Italian National Archives, Middleton's parents, both of British descent, relocated to Italy in the early 1900s, where his father worked as a diplomat.\"}, \"D2S5\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 657, \"end\": 786, \"text\": \"Born in Milan in 1907, Middleton spent his formative years in Italy, developing a deep affection for the country and its culture.\"}, \"D2S6\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 787, \"end\": 962, \"text\": \"\\\"I always knew my father had a special connection to Italy, but I had no idea it went this far,\\\" said Middleton's daughter, actress Julia Middleton, in an exclusive interview.\"}, \"D2S7\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 963, \"end\": 1027, \"text\": \"\\\"It's amazing to think that he was, in fact, an Italian citizen.\"}, \"D2S8\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1028, \"end\": 1107, \"text\": \"It explains so much about his love for the language, the food, and the people.\\\"\"}, \"D2S9\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1108, \"end\": 1121, \"text\": \"Historian Dr.\"}, \"D2S10\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1122, \"end\": 1237, \"text\": \"Alessandro Bianchi, who has spent years researching Middleton's life, shed more light on the actor's Italian roots.\"}, \"D2S11\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1238, \"end\": 1337, \"text\": \"\\\"Middleton's family was part of the British expat community in Italy during the early 20th century.\"}, \"D2S12\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1338, \"end\": 1482, \"text\": \"His father's diplomatic work allowed them to move freely between the two countries, and Guy grew up speaking both English and Italian fluently.\\\"\"}, \"D2S13\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1483, \"end\": 1646, \"text\": \"Bianchi pointed to a 1920s photograph, recently discovered in the archives, showing a young Middleton posing with his family in front of the iconic Duomo in Milan.\"}, \"D2S14\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1647, \"end\": 1711, \"text\": \"\\\"This image is a testament to the strong bond he had with Italy.\"}, \"D2S15\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1712, \"end\": 1797, \"text\": \"It's clear that his Italian upbringing had a profound impact on his life and career.\\\"\"}, \"D2S16\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1798, \"end\": 1890, \"text\": \"Middleton's Italian citizenship was officially recognized in 1935, when he was 28 years old.\"}, \"D2S17\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1891, \"end\": 1992, \"text\": \"The actor's dual nationality remained a private matter, known only to his closest family and friends.\"}, \"D2S18\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1993, \"end\": 2128, \"text\": \"\\\"It's fascinating to think about how this aspect of his life influenced his performances,\\\" said film critic and historian, Mark Harris.\"}, \"D2S19\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2129, \"end\": 2257, \"text\": \"\\\"Middleton's ability to bring depth and nuance to his characters might be attributed, in part, to his unique cultural heritage.\\\"\"}}, \"original_cards\": [], \"R5_answers\": [\"United Kingdom of Great Britain and Ireland\", \"Italy\"], \"candidates\": [{\"id\": \"C0\", \"answer\": \"United Kingdom of Great Britain and Ireland\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}, {\"id\": \"C1\", \"answer\": \"Italy\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}]}"
